"Same day: about 15-75 minutes at MIT, paid in cash","ar":"في نفس اليوم: حوالي 15 إلى 75 دقيقة في الوزارة، والدفع نقداً"},"verified":"yes"},"condition":"always","notes":{"en":"Take a queue number at MIT in Abdali (outside Amman, the MIT directorate in your governorate) and fill in the trader declaration and pledge forms. Minimum declared capital is 1,000 JOD and no deposit is needed.","ar":"خذ رقم دور في الوزارة في العبدلي (وخارج عمّان مديرية الصناعة والتجارة في محافظتك) واملأ نموذجي تصريح احتراف التجارة والتعهد. الحد الأدنى لرأس المال المصرح به 1,000 دينار ولا يشترط إيداعه."},"sourceIds":["S1","S5","S8"],"key":"register_sole_proprietorship","legalForm":"home_business"},{"order":3,"id":"chamber_of_industry","title":{"en":"Join the Amman Chamber of Industry","ar":"الانتساب لغرفة صناعة عمّان"},"officeId":"ACI","requiredDocs":[{"docId":"registration_certificate","condition":"always"},{"docId":"lease_contract","condition":"if_rented"},{"docId":"property_ownership_document","condition":"always"},{"docId":"national_id","condition":"always"},{"docId":"trade_name_certificate","condition":"if_trade_name"}],"fee":{"minJod":40,"maxJod":175,"note":{"en":"Annual fee by capital (20 JOD under 10,000 JOD; 30 / 40 / 70 JOD above) + registration fee of 50% of the annual fee + community service fee (10 JOD under 10,000; 20 / 20 / 70 above). Under 10,000 JOD of capital it''s 40 JOD.","ar":"اشتراك سنوي حسب رأس المال (20 ديناراً لأقل من 10,000؛ 30 / 40 / 70 ديناراً لما فوق) + رسم تسجيل بنسبة 50% من الاشتراك السنوي + رسم خدمة مجتمع (10 دنانير لأقل من 10,000؛ 20 / 20 / 70 لما فوق). لرأس مال أقل من 10,000 دينار المجموع 40 ديناراً."},"verified":"yes"},"days":{"value":0,"note":{"en":"Same day: 5-15 minutes at the chamber''s office in the Ministry building","ar":"في نفس اليوم: 5 إلى 15 دقيقة في مكتب الغرفة داخل مبنى الوزارة"},"verified":"yes"},"condition":"if_food","notes":{"en":"Home food production counts as industry, so it''s the Chamber of Industry rather than the Chamber of Commerce.","ar":"يُعد تصنيع الغذاء المنزلي نشاطاً صناعياً، لذا الانتساب لغرفة الصناعة وليس غرفة التجارة."},"sourceIds":["S8"],"key":"chamber_of_industry","legalForm":"home_business"},{"order":4,"id":"gam_rental_certificate","title":{"en":"Get GAM''s rent-contract certificate","ar":"الحصول على شهادة عقد الإيجار من الأمانة"},"officeId":"GAM","requiredDocs":[{"docId":"lease_contract","condition":"always"},{"docId":"property_ownership_document","condition":"always"},{"docId":"national_id","condition":"always"}],"fee":{"minJod":null,"maxJod":null,"note":{"en":"0.5% of the annual rent (max 15 JOD) + 0.3% of the total contract value in stamps","ar":"0.5% من الإيجار السنوي (بحد أقصى 15 ديناراً) + 0.003 من قيمة العقد الكلية طوابع"},"verified":"yes"},"days":{"value":0,"note":{"en":"Online, same day","ar":"إلكترونياً في نفس اليوم"},"verified":"yes"},"condition":"if_rented","notes":{"en":"Only if you rent the home.","ar":"فقط إذا كان المنزل مستأجراً."},"sourceIds":["S8"],"key":"gam_rental_certificate","legalForm":"home_business"},{"order":5,"id":"jfda_home_food_license","title":{"en":"Get JFDA food processing and label approval","ar":"الحصول على موافقة الغذاء والدواء على التصنيع والملصق"},"officeId":"JFDA","requiredDocs":[{"docId":"registration_certificate","condition":"always"},{"docId":"lease_contract","condition":"if_rented"},{"docId":"property_ownership_document","condition":"always"},{"docId":"building_documents","condition":"always"},{"docId":"building_residents_consent","condition":"always"},{"docId":"inspection_pledge","condition":"always"},{"docId":"product_label","condition":"always"},{"docId":"national_id","condition":"always"}],"fee":{"minJod":200,"maxJod":null,"note":{"en":"100 JOD permit application + 10 JOD label approval per food type + 90 JOD lab tests per sample (30 physical, 30 microbiological, 30 chemical). For one food type: 200 JOD.","ar":"100 دينار طلب التصريح + 10 دنانير لاعتماد الملصق لكل نوع غذاء + 90 ديناراً فحوص مخبرية لكل عينة (30 فيزيائي، 30 ميكروبيولوجي، 30 كيم